# Run outputs: transcripts, manifests, cost reports.
runs/

# G16: the held-out private scenario pool must never enter version control.
# Publishing it would let a contestant train or hand-tune against the exact
# tasks it is scored on, which destroys the benchmark's discriminative power.
# Keep it local (or in a separate access-controlled store) forever.
private-pool/

